<title>MOROCCO: Morocco increases foreign investment.</title>
<headline>Morocco increases foreign investment.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreign investment in Morocco soared to $545 million (5.4 billion dirhams) in the first half of 1997 from $161 in the same period in 1996, a finance ministry official said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We should reach a $1.0 billion (the amount of foreign investment) at the end of the year 1997,&quot; added Mohamed Aref Hassani, a foreign investment director at the ministry.</p>
<p>South Korea's Daewoo Corp has the bigest share of the foreign investment with about $400 million, according to officials.</p>
<p>($1 = 9.9 dirhams)</p>
</text>
